stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: 主研究派生
  queued --> starting: 获得分支并发槽
  starting --> running: 子进程身份已保存
  running --> completed: 检查点完成
  running --> failed: 子进程异常
  queued --> cancelled: 启动前取消
  starting --> cancelled: 协调取消
  running --> cancelled: 定向或整轮停止
  running --> interrupted: 进程丢失或父host失效
  completed --> queued: 显式恢复，新mission
  failed --> queued: 显式恢复
  cancelled --> queued: 显式恢复
  interrupted --> queued: 显式恢复
